title: Close Project
intro: File, Close Project returns the editor to the start.
project: Platformer | Quick Close

chapter: Closing the project | Back to the start
say: Done with this project? File, Close Project puts the editor back as it was before any project was open.
menu: File > Close Project
expectproject: none
explain: panel:Hierarchy | Nothing open | The scene, its panels and everything the project held are let go. Open or create a project to carry on.
